00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:10.760
So without further ado,
what is Spring Native?

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.680
Simply put, Spring
Native is a project

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:15.230
to make it easier for developers
to compile their Spring

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.730
